#. Skin Element Text: text welcome / Text
#. Skin Element Text: text welcome_mobile / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Desa Penglipuran, sebuah permata tersembunyi di pulau Bali "
"yang memancarkan keindahan budaya dan kearifan lokal. Terletak di kaki "
"Gunung Batur, Waktu tempuh dari Ubud ke Desa Penglipuran sekitar 1 jam. Desa "
"ini telah memperoleh berbagai penghargaan sebagai desa terbersih di "
"Indonesia dan sebagai pelopor dalam menjaga kelestarian alamnya."
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Penglipuran Village, a hidden gem on the island of Bali that "
"exudes the beauty of culture and local wisdom. Located at the foot of Mount "
"Batur, the travel time from Ubud to Penglipuran Village is about 1 hour. "
"This village has received various awards as the cleanest village in "
"Indonesia and as a pioneer in preserving its natural environment."
